cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If this software contributes to published research, please cite both this
  repository and the companion paper. See REFERENCES.md for the methods,
  datasets and prior work this package builds on, each of which carries its
  own citation.
title: heliostat
abstract: >-
  Heliostat-field simulation for concentrating solar power towers: field
  layouts, Monte Carlo and cone-optics ray tracing, flux maps, shading and
  blocking, DNI handling, and annual energy, with an interactive local web
  app.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Eads
    given-names: Ryker
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/wilryk/heliostat"
version: 0.1.0.dev0
keywords:
  - heliostat
  - concentrating solar power
  - solar tower
  - ray tracing
  - optics
